## Timeline

### Key moments

{% if r.kind == "investigation" %}
Each credential issuance (and failed credential request), the first use of each key, the first successful call, the first burst of denied and of failed calls (at least {{ r.moments.burst_events }} within {{ r.moments.burst_seconds }} seconds), and each finding{{ cut(r.moments, "moments") }}.
{% else %}
Each finding at its first evidence event{{ cut(r.moments, "findings") }}.
{% endif %}

{% if r.moments.rows %}
| Time | Moment | Session | What happened | Evidence |
|---|---|---|---|---|
{% for m in r.moments.rows %}
| {{ m.time | time }} | {{ m.kind }} | {{ m.session }} | {{ m.text }} | {{ m.evidence | join(", ") }} |
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
None.
{% endif %}

