## Session graph

{% if r.graph is none %}
Not part of a findings report: an investigation report follows one identity and the credentials it obtained.
{% else %}
{{ r.graph.sessions | count("session") }}, up to {{ r.graph.deepest | count("pivot") }} deep. A session is the starting identity (S0) or a key it obtained; a pivot is the credential-issuing call that links them. Evidence: the issuing call, the call that created or issued the key, and the session's first and last event.

{% for n in r.graph.tree %}
{% set pad = "  " * n.level %}
{% if n.more %}
{{ pad }}- {{ n.more | count("more session") }} obtained here: see the JSON file.
{% else %}
{{ pad }}- **{{ n.label }}**: {{ n.kind }} {{ n.id }}{% if n.via %}, obtained in {{ n.via.from }} via {{ n.via.api }}{% if n.via.target %} for {{ n.via.target }}{% endif %} at {{ n.via.time | time }}{% endif +%}
{{ pad }}  - {{ n.events | count("event") }} ({{ n.succeeded | num }} succeeded, {{ n.denied | num }} denied, {{ n.failed | num }} failed), {{ n.first_seen | span(n.last_seen) }}
{% for o in n.issued_by %}
{{ pad }}  - Key {{ "created" if o.api == "iam:CreateAccessKey" else "issued" }} by {{ o.api }}, called by {{ o.caller }} at {{ o.event_time | time }}
{% endfor %}
{{ pad }}  - Identities: {{ n.identities | top }}
{{ pad }}  - Source IPs: {{ n.source_ips | top }}{% if r.ip_warning %} (anonymised by the dataset publisher, see the indicators){% endif +%}
{{ pad }}  - User agents: {{ n.user_agents | top }}
{{ pad }}  - Regions: {{ n.regions | top }}
{{ pad }}  - Evidence: {{ n.evidence | join(", ") }}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% if r.graph.not_followed %}
Credential calls that did not lead to a new session:

| Status | API | Calls | Meaning | Evidence (first) |
|---|---|---:|---|---|
{% for g in r.graph.not_followed %}
| {{ g.status }} | {{ g.api }} | {{ g.calls | num }} | {{ g.meaning }} | {{ g.evidence | join(", ") }} |
{% endfor %}

{% endif %}
{% endif %}
